<title>AUSTRALIA: Schroders Property to sell office tower.</title>
<headline>Schroders Property to sell office tower.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property investment company Schroders Property said on Monday it is putting a 45 level North Sydney office tower up for sale.</p>
<p>The 34,500 square metre landmark Northpoint property comprises 32 levels of offices and is 88 percent occupied and has a total book value of around A$126 million, the company said.</p>
<p>&quot;The sale is part of a continuing rebalancing of our property fund,&quot; a company official told Reuters.</p>
<p>Schroders recently purchased a property in Perth, Western Australia for A$106 million.</p>
<p>Formal offers close on July 7 through Colliers Jardine.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
